   "data": {
    "text": "SPEED & TIMING\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 12, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Clip speed\n   2 Reverse and replay\n   3 Freeze frame\n   4 Jump cuts\n   5 Cutting to the beat\n   6 Pace across the scene\n   7 Edit template\n   8 Something new every\n   9 Slow motion quality\n  10 suite: Viral edit\n  11 suite: Music video\n  12 suite: Trailer\n  13 suite: Vlog kit\n  14 suite: Instant replay\n  15 pair: When the music is featured, the cuts find the beat\n  16 pair: When jump cuts go rhythmic, a joke builds\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 13, CC 1 to 5\n   1 pair: When seconds are left on the clock, the cutting gets fast\n   2 pair: When a clip slows way down, it needs smooth in-between frames\n   3 pair: When something new arrives every second or two, the jokes come faster\n   4 pair: When the edit template is meme, the smash cuts pile up\n   5 pairs: Music leads the edit"
   },
